<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Blaine County Sheriff's Office — Portal</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Official portal for the Blaine County Sheriff's Office FiveM roleplay department. Apply to a subdivision below." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/bcso-crest.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/bcso-crest.png" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div id="site-header-mount"></div>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <img class="crest" src="assets/bcso-crest.png" alt="Blaine County Sheriff's Office Crest" />
        <h1>Blaine County Sheriff's Office</h1>
        <div class="motto">Respectful &middot; Professional &middot; Ethical &middot; Service to All</div>
        <div class="established">Established 1908</div>
        <p class="lead">
          Welcome to the official BCSO applications portal. Browse our
          subdivisions below and submit an application directly &mdash;
          no account or login required. Every application goes straight
          to our command staff on Discord.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="applications.html">View Subdivisions &amp; Apply</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://discord.gg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join our Discord</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Values</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Every deputy of the Blaine County Sheriff's Office is held to the same standard, on and off duty.</p>
        <div class="value-grid">
          <div class="panel value-card">
            <div class="icon">&#9878;</div>
            <h3>Respectful</h3>
            <p>Treating every citizen and colleague with dignity, regardless of the situation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="panel value-card">
            <div class="icon">&#127942;</div>
            <h3>Professional</h3>
            <p>Holding ourselves to a high standard of conduct, communication, and procedure.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="panel value-card">
            <div class="icon">&#9878;&#65039;</div>
            <h3>Ethical</h3>
            <p>Doing what's right, even when no one is watching.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="panel value-card">
            <div class="icon">&#128737;&#65039;</div>
            <h3>Service to All</h3>
            <p>Blaine County is our home, and every resident deserves our best.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="alt">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Ready to Join a Subdivision?</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Take a look at our specialised subdivisions — Traffic Enforcement, Organised
          Crime, Natural Resources &amp; Environment, and Recruitment &amp; Training —
          and apply in a couple of minutes.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="applications.html">Browse Subdivisions</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <div id="site-footer-mount"></div>
  <script src="assets/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
